=== Glass Unit ===
id: services.reminderQuips
version: 0.2.0
language: typescript

=== Intent ===
purpose: Provide a personality-aware daily quip for reminder messages. Generates a fresh quip per personality per day via AI (cached in KV) with curated per-personality static fallback lists for reliability. Uses PERSONALITY_PROMPTS from botPersonality module to match the user's tone.
source:
  kind: prd
  reference: "Personality Voice Everywhere — Reminder Quips"
parent: null
stakeholder: user
subIntents: []
approvalStatus: approved

=== Contract ===
requires:
  - "KV namespace binding for caching daily quips"
  - "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY for AI-generated quips (optional)"
  - "BotPersonality type from botPersonality module"
guarantees:
  on_success:
    - "getDailyQuip accepts personality parameter and returns a personality-appropriate quip"
    - "AI-generated quips cached in KV with key reminder_quip:YYYY-MM-DD:{personality} and 48h TTL"
    - "Same quip returned for all callers with same personality on same day"
    - "Quips are harmless, non-vulgar, and match the user's personality tone"
    - "FALLBACK_QUIPS is a per-personality Record with ~15+ quips per personality"
    - "getFallbackQuip accepts optional personality parameter"
  on_failure:
    - "AI failure falls back to personality-specific FALLBACK_QUIPS rotated by day-of-year"
    - "Missing API key uses static fallback without attempting AI"
invariants:
  - "At most one AI call per calendar day per personality (up to 4/day total)"
  - "Encouraging personality has at least 50 fallback quips"
  - "Other personalities have at least 15 fallback quips each"
  - "Quips are under 15 words"
fails:
  AnthropicError: "Fall back to personality-specific static quip list"
  KVError: "Fall back to personality-specific static quip list"
